# Copy to .env and edit. Never commit .env.
# Nothing secret belongs here: the admin password, master key and Cloudflare token
# are all created or entered in the admin site.
# Only Caddy publishes ports (443 and 80). The server and the admin publish none.

# URL clients use to reach the API (goes into pairing strings). Leave it unset to use the host name once one
# is set, and before that the address you opened the admin site with. Set it when clients must use another
# address, e.g. https://192.168.1.20
# ASKBAR_PUBLIC_URL=

# Where the server's database lives on the host. Must be writable by uid 10002 (the server image's user;
# it was 10001 before 0.3.0). Hostname, certificate token and allowed networks are set in the admin site.
DATA_DIR=./data

# Pre-built images instead of building them here (docs/guide.md, "Using pre-built images"). Unset, the images are built
# from this checkout and named askbar-<service>:latest. The registry ends with a slash; the tag is main, an exact
# release (1.0.0), a minor (1.0) or a major (1).
# ASKBAR_IMAGE_REGISTRY=ghcr.io/thewuuryar/
# ASKBAR_IMAGE_TAG=main
